omx-contract (3.12.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 3.12.0
  * package-files: the catalogs are read from the tree's root, not from data/
  * package-files: omx-contract-data holds its catalogs
  * catalogs: omx-contract's Catalan addresses the reader as the desk does
  * validate --catalogs <dir>: an owner checks its catalogs against its
    installed package
  * text.ca deprecated, not refused: 3.12.0 a true minor; panel.* codes
  * text: the source sentence alone, translations in owners' catalogs (schema
    3.12.0)
  * words: a sentence per language beside the word, as a code has (schema
    3.12.0)
  * README: run CI on the recreated repository
  * docs: cite plugin-hostd and omx-contract by their new issue numbers
  * README: refresh apt after adding the repository, download into /tmp

